[{"client_msg_id":"ce6b936e-d9d6-46c7-9264-d8de957fbcd7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"このままWeb版も読んでどんどん酷い目に合うスバルを見届けて欲しい\n最終的にほとんどのキャラ好きになれるんですけど、エキドナはバックボーンまだほとんど明かされてないので好きにはなれない","ts":"1616238082.047200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bcii9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3ab83fd-6004-4b17-9b45-154953aa613b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ああいう、過去を背負って知られずに生きているキャラが大好き","ts":"1616238006.045900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RDyu3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4232cc31-8201-418b-bd5e-375aaa01340b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"他アニメ出すけど、プランダラのリヒトに近い感じ","ts":"1616237991.045300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C/Ik"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab68c55b-3d47-46da-ab62-49dcf115bdd3","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"「ペテ公に悲しき過去……」ですからね\n多分この為に1期から松岡禎丞キャスティングしてたんだろうなと","ts":"1616237943.044500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HOb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9cb34b7-6ee8-4a00-9f13-8f46ce9f1b2e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あいつどんな心情だったのかなと今は余韻に浸ってる","ts":"1616237926.044100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hmp9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6513e65f-e505-4e56-8b3f-1f8712d5ed97","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"最初の方は、エミリア推しだったけど、魔女が出てき始めたところでエキドナ、ミネルヴァに上書きされ、二期を見ているうちに\nペテルギウス・ロマネコンティが好きになった","ts":"1616237909.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gt2Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a97dbc2-12a7-4f0e-acdf-5b8a156c6cb2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティ…","ts":"1616237827.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I421M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43ce902d-deec-4a2a-a742-68f729d1c9ee","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあその3人はあまり好きになれなくても、スバルが守る対象としてる事に納得できれば支障ないと思います\nリゼロ、どちらかと言えば男キャラの魅力が大きい","ts":"1616237786.040900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BTU8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4229a15-f8c7-415d-97be-4b42a81f9f32","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"魔女でいうと、ミネルヴァも好きです（金髪ポニテボーイッシュという好みどストライク）\n逆に、ラムレムエミリアを余り好きになれなかった","ts":"1616237645.038900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NVf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47a2ad06-03d8-4d1c-967b-d87f702fa7f8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど、自分は結構好きでしたね。知識欲の深さとか結構共感できる","ts":"1616237579.037500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g/+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"026ecfe8-1bdd-49c7-b0b3-a3dcf8d5daec","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"エキドナ、キャラ造形としては好きなんですけどキャラ自体はあまり好きになれないですね","ts":"1616237454.036100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rvx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d9d015b-a32a-4303-889e-80efd3b5e76e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"エキドナかわいい、わかります","ts":"1616229178.035300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOB96"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c00731b3-a4d3-4ff3-b377-443c00bad324","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"リゼロの中の登場人物だと、推しは「ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティ、エキドナ」になりました","ts":"1616221093.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ffWn9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"554ac96c-b96f-4159-8410-0bde857758d4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ネタバレになるといけないので多くは語りませんが、ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティに関して「そういうことか」となった\nあと、エキドナかわいい","ts":"1616221058.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EpWCv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0e93047-6aa0-4397-8b85-9ff55f7bedb5","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"リゼロ、1,2期合計49話全制覇した","ts":"1616220993.033200","edited":{"user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","ts":"1616221002.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cw_cracker","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=O5m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83b79672-5323-42ff-9aac-3d9e7cc926fe","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"3も早く出ないかな。同じころになるのかな。","ts":"1616169530.032700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"79zv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32a3b8af-1bd3-4fc8-a9d3-2c7984c66bdd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ポンポさんついに映画の公開日も決まったんだよねぇ。","ts":"1616169517.032300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/wP4B"}]}]
